# m3w Gitea at https://git.m3w.org/ - PRIVATE ONLY. The guard refuses to enable or push unless the repository is verified private. SSH port/host-key UNCONFIRMED.
# DISABLED (suffix .disabled: install_upstreams.sh and push_all.sh glob *.sh and ignore this file).
# SNAPSHOT-ONLY: this URL is the one-way PUBLIC repo (job_seeker_public, fresh history). It is fed ONLY by scripts/publish_snapshot.sh push;
